[[0,1314225,0,3,0,3,"2016-09-28T21:40:26","Lobotomy","",[],"<p>Not excited, neither are the locals. </p>\n<p>I live in the Midwest equivalent of San Francisco, with a dash if Portland, for good measure. Total blue city. That said, there are a grand total of THREE Hillary banners in the whole town of fifty thousand people, and on the flipside of that, there is a 60 foot tall wooden tower with Trump's name on it, right downtown as well as hundreds of lawn banners. Despite this being Democrat territory, she will not be received well.</p>\n<p>Incidentally, Bernie Sanders had stopped here during his campaign, with Trump campaigning in a nearby town that same day, both with immensely positive turnouts. I doubt that Chelsea will be as welcome.</p>","Chelsea Clinton is coming to my hometown...","","politics"]]
